{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0603_1000_p", "source_sha256": "320bb1b30524dab3ac2d33bb4859441c84a41d04a111fcb4e6fec39377b1b326", "ja": "（今日の紗代子の仕事は、情報番組出演。生放送\nだったけど、BOTのPRもしっかりこなしてくれた）", "zh": "（今天纱代子的工作是参加资讯节目。虽然是现场直播，但她也顺利完成了BOT的宣传）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0603_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8249701a8d08a256004ba643ad95ef435718d43a20d7f597c72a91a79c382aba", "ja": "紗代子、お疲れさま。いい感じだったぞ！\nトークも盛り上がったし、バッチリ宣伝もできたな。", "zh": "纱代子，辛苦了。表现得很不错！\n聊天环节气氛也很热烈，宣传也做得很到位。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0603_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "de291e35b679d0aa488ba1f85b524fe821ad629c71e964d4b2c9edb72c28ca28", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　あとは番組を観てくれた\n人にも、興味を持ってもらえるといいんですけど。", "zh": "谢谢！接下来要是连看了节目的人也能产生兴趣，那就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0603_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "a2e03f6ea75a009ccd7f82fa9076027eba192ec82bb4ee17d3fea53bb774ee62", "ja": "この後は、恵美ちゃんたちと合流して……\n雑誌の取材と、写真撮影ですよね。", "zh": "接下来要和惠美她们汇合……然后接受杂志采访，再拍照，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0603_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c8b53a2480efce7f7336b0a1e3d440468570da9807c1daf2b130498dec9fda22", "ja": "ああ。でも1時間くらい空きがあるから、\n今のうちに休憩しておこう。", "zh": "啊。不过中间大概有1个小时的空档，先趁现在休息一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0603_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "80d477df508cfa9aa24368355a1c39c654454385ee79ee873557650add799ab7", "ja": "なら、台本をチェックしてもいいですか？\n明日の分、今のうちにやっておきたくて。", "zh": "那么，我可以确认一下剧本吗？\n我想趁现在先把明天的份也准备好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0603_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e7b379c68ef8d72eda8c36663f0818906af7a0fc3ffadf2b8c47d262b93cd1a4", "ja": "いいけど、大丈夫か？　休まなくて。\n今日はスタートも早かったろ。", "zh": "可以是可以，不过没问题吗？不休息一下？\n今天开始得也挺早的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0603_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "187444aca424b6de5f476c8ab03597da8b3d71632329ec67ea51a3fb7b42ee0e", "ja": "大丈夫です！　休日で学校もない日だから、\n目いっぱい予定をこなしたいって言ったのは私ですし。", "zh": "没问题的！毕竟今天放假不用上学，\n我也说了希望能尽量把日程排满。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0603_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "a659a9850dc5f325faa5c17dbb6d7cc1fb9a8920894999c705628409cc3f9aeb", "ja": "それに、恵美ちゃんも茜ちゃんも\nがんばってるんだから……負けていられません！", "zh": "而且，惠美和小茜都在努力……我可不能输给你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0603_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "02514eedfef181e9f2c7496bfb8fe56eef18e14cc5cf469b6a3da00c15505d45", "ja": "ん……あれ？　すみません{$P$}、\nちょっとだけ、待ってもらえますか？", "zh": "嗯……咦？不好意思，{$P$}先生，能稍微等我一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0603_1010_p", "source_sha256": "1bb6e048c4dd07c7546f892a44e7baa4c5d0ded793b54863ac8120b4f6995d2f", "ja": "もちろんいいよ。\n何か急ぎの用事か？", "zh": "当然可以。\n是有什么急事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0603_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "06e1ab3de17d9e591a83930c44ca93b8cd72ae60e786d6117f882b262319071a", "ja": "……学校のみんなから、グループメッセージです。\n『生放送、見てたよ！』って……。", "zh": "……是学校的朋友们发来的群消息。\n说『看了直播哦！』……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0603_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "15c9914558a140cd1c06195727540bc44baa6aba28bad11e342d888ff42e57d6", "ja": "『BATTLE OF THEATER、観に行くね』\n『PRINCESSを応援するよ！』……。", "zh": "“我们会去现场看BATTLE OF THEATER的”\n“会给PRINCESS加油的！”……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0603_1013_p", "source_sha256": "61518a7b3082058178475561614a8ec6171236274982ca9b42cf832ea91d7241", "ja": "学校の友達が……そうか。\n良かったな。", "zh": "学校的朋友发来的吗……这样啊。\n太好了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0603_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "d39380d0ec07ba2746308179fa3179358ccc76a0f604d15fb706adcdfe101ea4", "ja": "みんな、わざわざリアルタイムで観てくれたんだ。\n明日会ったら、お礼を言わなきゃ。", "zh": "大家特意实时观看了直播。\n明天见面时，我得向他们道谢才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0603_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "a96f2282d852725e479795128d36c58bde0e3eff3e15de598c44076ca8c2afd5", "ja": "ううん、それだけじゃないですね。もっともっと\nがんばって、みんなの期待に応えないと！", "zh": "不，不只是这样。还得更加努力，回应大家的期待才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0603_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c7d67f7012339b9e4983764729418d4ec5f1ba92ade420233d54f4793219d4a7", "ja": "そうだな。友達も、紗代子を心から応援して\nくれてるんだ。もちろん、無理は禁物だけど。", "zh": "是啊。朋友们也都在真心支持纱代子。当然，不能勉强自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0603_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "0e54d4dd9b72623dea84371340d7a6116e58b57077b6d057fae5a43c1c811dd9", "ja": "はい！　もちろん、無理はしないように……\nでも私なりに、全力でぶつかっていきますね！", "zh": "是！当然，我会注意不勉强自己……不过，我也会以自己的方式全力以赴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
